<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Checkmate cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Checkmate cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Securities said it downgraded Checkmate Electronics Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- said cut the 12-month price target to $13 from $18.</p>
<p>-- said trimmed second quarter earnings estimate to a loss of $0.02 a share from a profit of $0.23 a share.</p>
<p>-- said cut the full year 1997 estimate to $0.30 a share from $0.75 a share and cut the 1998 estimate to $0.67 a share from $0.99 a share.</p>
<p>-- Checkmate Electronics lost 1-5/8 to 8-3/8.</p>
<p>-- On Friday, Checkmate said its second quarter estimates &quot;may not exceed break-even.&quot; The company cited softness in retail capital spending.</p>
</text>
